      "en": "Pandora at MotoDays 2026"
    },
    "excerpt": {
      "en": "Pandora at MotoDays 2026, Fiera di Roma, 6–8 March: Moto V2 and Moto EVO live at Hall 3, Booth B9."
    },
    "body": {
      "en": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Pandora is taking part in MotoDays 2026 at Fiera di Roma (6–8 March 2026, Hall 3, Booth B9), one of the most important motorcycle exhibitions in Europe."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A unique chance to meet the Pandora team in person and see the latest developments in motorcycle security systems: GNSS technology, A-GPS operation, CAN Bus FD specifications, and the alarm working live through the mobile app. Featured systems: Pandora Moto V2 and Pandora Moto EVO."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "We don't follow standards. We create them. Want to join the network? INVETEC works with 100+ partners in 5 countries."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
